As github has a limit of up to 100 MB per file, i can not upload the datasets there.

In order to execute the code, you should have a folder named "archive" with the 5 datasets inside it.

The source to download the datasets is:

https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mizanunswcyber/iot-and-non-iot-device-classification-dataset 

The datasets are the following:
- CIC_IoT_Part_1.csv
- CIC_IoT_Part_2.csv
- Lab_1.csv
- Lab_2.csv
- UNSW_IoT_Traces.csv